2026-07-27T14:54:29.5487298Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:54:29.5488224Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
